{
  "configuration_id": "config_010",
  "reason": "With only one completed experiment (config_001: rna_only, singleprofile, pca_n2000 → 48.5% acc), the largest source of uncertainty is whether the image modality carries useful signal at all. config_010 (image_only, singleprofile, resnet50) is the simplest image baseline and directly tests this question in isolation. If image accuracy is competitive or better than the RNA baseline, it strongly motivates investing remaining budget in multimodal configurations; if it is substantially worse, we can deprioritize image and multimodal configs and focus on RNA encoder and profile improvements. This single experiment bifurcates the search space and is the highest-information next step before committing to more complex multimodal or multiprofile designs."
}

